usage: onesar_rerun.py [-h] --subject SUBJECT --family FAMILY --evidence-out
                       EVIDENCE_OUT [--timeout TIMEOUT]
                       [--repo-root REPO_ROOT] [--archive ARCHIVE]

Thin single-subject, single-family 1SAR R-factor execution and retained-record
verification harness.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --subject SUBJECT     Single preregistered trajectory subject to evaluate
                        (start, R4, R5, R6; lowercase aliases r4, r5, r6
                        accepted; R7/r7/all rejected).
  --family FAMILY       Single measurement family to run (only 'rfactors' is
                        supported).
  --evidence-out EVIDENCE_OUT
                        Fresh non-existing repository-local parent evidence
                        directory <parent A>.
  --timeout TIMEOUT     Finite positive per-producer operation timeout in
                        seconds (default: 900.0).
  --repo-root REPO_ROOT
                        Repository root directory (default: current repository
                        root).
  --archive ARCHIVE     Optional override path to the verified 1SAR archive
                        ZIP.
